## Executive Summary

Q1 2024 delivered strong results with revenue of $32.5 million, representing 78.6% year-over-year growth and 20.4% quarter-over-quarter growth from Q4 2023. This was our strongest first quarter ever and puts us on track to achieve our FY 2024 guidance.

### Key Metrics

| Metric | Q1 2024 | Q4 2023 | Q1 2023 | QoQ Change | YoY Change |
|--------|---------|---------|---------|------------|------------|
| Revenue | $32.5M | $27.0M | $18.2M | +20.4% | +78.6% |
| Gross Profit | $24.1M | $19.7M | $13.2M | +22.3% | +82.6% |
| Gross Margin | 74.2% | 73.0% | 72.5% | +1.2 pts | +1.7 pts |
| Operating Income | $1.8M | ($0.5M) | ($3.8M) | — | — |
| ARR (end of period) | $138.5M | $95.8M | $62.5M | +44.6% | +121.6% |
| Total Customers | 485 | 412 | 325 | +17.7% | +49.2% |

